<< /AP << /N 30 0 R >> /BS << /S /I /W .5 >> /DA (/Helv 10 Tf .333333 .333333 .333333 rg) /DV (I currently live in [city], Alberta. I have been a resident of Alberta for [X] years. I rent / own [choose one] my current home. My rent / mortgage is $[amount]/month. My home is [describe any accessibility features you rely on: e.g. ground floor / no stairs / roll-in shower / widened doorways / elevator access]. I [do / do not] have a local support network in Alberta. My support network includes: [e.g. family members who provide care / a medical team I have worked with for X years / a specialist I see every X months / community supports I rely on for [describe]]. If I were forced to relocate, I would lose access to [describe: my specialist / my pharmacy / my care worker / my support system]. Re-establishing care in a new province would require [describe: finding a new family doctor in a province with a doctor shortage / re-applying for disability supports / re-qualifying for coverage of my medical supplies / waiting months for new assessments]. I [have / do not have] a vehicle. The cost of relocating -- including first and last months rent, a damage deposit, moving a household, and transport of medical equipment -- would be approximately $[estimate]. I do not have access to these funds. I am effectively financially unable to exercise my Section 6 constitutional right to move, because the ADAP transition has left me without the means to do so.) /F 4 /FT /Tx /Ff 4096 /MK << /BC [ .733333 .733333 .733333 ] /BG [ 1 1 1 ] >> /MaxLen 100 /P 25 0 R /Rect [ 36 281 576 363 ] /Subtype /Widget /T (nb_housing) /TU (Describe your current housing and what relocation would mean for you:) /Type /Annot /V (I currently live in [city], Alberta. I have been a resident of Alberta for [X] years. I rent / own [choose one] my current home. My rent / mortgage is $[amount]/month. My home is [describe any accessibility features you rely on: e.g. ground floor / no stairs / roll-in shower / widened doorways / elevator access]. I [do / do not] have a local support network in Alberta. My support network includes: [e.g. family members who provide care / a medical team I have worked with for X years / a specialist I see every X months / community supports I rely on for [describe]]. If I were forced to relocate, I would lose access to [describe: my specialist / my pharmacy / my care worker / my support system]. Re-establishing care in a new province would require [describe: finding a new family doctor in a province with a doctor shortage / re-applying for disability supports / re-qualifying for coverage of my medical supplies / waiting months for new assessments]. I [have / do not have] a vehicle. The cost of relocating -- including first and last months rent, a damage deposit, moving a household, and transport of medical equipment -- would be approximately $[estimate]. I do not have access to these funds. I am effectively financially unable to exercise my Section 6 constitutional right to move, because the ADAP transition has left me without the means to do so.) >>
endobj
